<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erwecken</unclear>, weil uns ohne das ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeither</unclear>
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fast</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alles</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ohngleich</unclear>, wider <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verschulden</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">außgelegt</unclear>
<lb n="30"/>würdt.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2187_8220.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="31"/>Solches nun so <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">langes</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">suochen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuofuekhomen</unclear>, und
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">doch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wt</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nichts</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">destoweniger</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihres</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">intents</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">halber</unclear>,
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mueglichste</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">satisfaction</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuegeben</unclear>: <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thuen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wir</unclear>
<lb n="34"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einen</unclear> andern, uns gleichwol nicht <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dienstpflichtigen</unclear>,
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">aber</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">doch</unclear> mit burgerrecht verwandten haubtmann
<lb n="36"/>und ingenier, näemlich herrn <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">haubtmann</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Adam</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Strauß</unclear>
<lb n="37"/>von Freudenberg</persName>, hiemit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ohnmaßgriflich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuerschlagen</unclear>,
<lb n="38"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wt</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daby</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">versichern</unclear>, das si sich deßelben
<lb n="39"/>etwas ohnvermerckhter und mit verhoffendem
<lb n="40"/>gleichmäeßigem effect, werdet bedienen khöenen:
<lb n="41"/>in erwegung, das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herr</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">haubtmann</unclear>
<lb n="42"/><persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Strauß</unclear></persName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auf</unclear> dem land wohnet, und ohne das die
<lb n="43"/>statt <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Sanct Gallen</placeName> jäerliches, auf etlich mahl,
<lb n="44"/>communicierens halber, bsuocht; Neben dem,
<lb n="45"/>alle unsere baw, di wir bißher, zuo bewahrung
<lb n="46"/>unser statt gefuehret, angeben, berathschlagen und
<lb n="47"/>fuehren helffen; Also, das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">von</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uns</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einen</unclear>
<lb n="48"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">trefflichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kriegserfahrnen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gelehrten</unclear> und hoch=
<lb n="49"/>verständigen mann gehalten wierdt.
<lb n="50"/>Woferrn nun <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wt</unclear>. diser unser wolmeinlicher
<lb n="51"/>fuerschlag gefellig, wöellen wir ihne herrn
<lb n="52"/>haubtman <persName resp="#ner">Strauß</persName>, verhoffentlich, leichsam dahin
<lb n="53"/>vermöegen, das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wt</unclear>. er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seiner</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gegen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihnen</unclear>,
<lb n="54"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sonst</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ievor</unclear> tragenden guotten affection, mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wuer=</unclear>
<lb n="55"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">cklicher</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erscheinung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">willen</unclear> werde. Im
<lb n="56"/>fall aber <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wt</unclear>. wider verhoffen, seiner person
<lb n="57"/>nicht begerig oder benuegig sein wuerdet:
<lb n="58"/>Wolten wir ohnvermerckt sehen und uns
<lb n="59"/>befleißen, wie <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wt</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hierunder</unclear>
<lb n="60"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weiter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuehand</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sehen</unclear>, und zuo benuegen
